          <a href="#using-the-floor" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. How to Use the Shop Floor Properly</a>
          <a href="#model-numbers" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. The Model Number Check</a>
          <a href="#price" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Getting the Price Right</a>
          <a href="#delivery" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Delivery, Assembly and Getting It Home</a>
          <a href="#protection-plans" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Protection Plans and Who Actually Fixes It</a>
          <a href="#when-to-buy-elsewhere" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. When to Buy Somewhere Else</a>
